.TH AVR\-ORG\-SAML\-REMOVE 1 "" "avr 0.3.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-saml-remove \- Remove the organization's SAML configuration (admin only).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org saml remove
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove the organization's SAML configuration (admin only).
.PP
Pass --yes to skip the confirmation prompt (required when prompts are disabled for automation).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR, \fB\-y\fR
Skip confirmation prompt.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-saml (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-configure (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-enforcement (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-show (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-sp-metadata (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-test (1)
